I noticed that you can have a pet with a passive attack[1] but you
can displace it without triggering its passive attack.

Looks to me rather like an oversight although I'm not sure if I'd be
annoyed to death if it were implemented more realistically.

OTOH why are you having a powerful pet like a cockatrice if you can't
handle it?

I think a not-stoning-resistant player should turn to stone if he's
displacing his pet cockatrice.

Bye
Patric

